---
title: Play-OEM data-view control flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Loader as Incremental loader
    participant App as PlayerApp
    participant Panel as Panel management
    participant Registry as DataViewRegistry
    participant View as Data view
    participant Store as OemDataStore

    Loader->>Store: Commit raw snapshot
    Loader->>App: Publish append/reset/tier notice
    App->>App: Resolve range and coverage
    App->>Store: Capture or refresh snapshot
    Store-->>App: StoreViewContext

    App->>Registry: Expand selection/preset
    Registry-->>App: Ordered canonical view names

    loop Each resolved view
        App->>Panel: Open or replace panel
        Panel->>View: Construct view
        App->>View: build_from_store(context)
        View->>Store: Query bounded derived/raw data
        Store-->>View: Snapshot-bound query result
        View-->>Panel: Figure or native wx window
        Panel->>Panel: Attach content and resources
    end

    loop Incremental refresh
        Loader->>App: Append/tier notice
        App->>Store: Refresh view context
        Store-->>App: Updated context
        App->>View: update_from_store(context)
        App->>View: set_time_range(resolved range, coverage)
        App->>View: update(playback time)
        View-->>Panel: Update artists/redraw
    end

    alt Range change
        App->>View: set_time_range(bounds, coverage)
        View->>Store: Query bounded range if needed
        Store-->>View: Range-limited result
        View-->>Panel: Update limits/artists
    else Playback seek
        App->>View: update(t_s)
        View-->>Panel: Move cursor/update status
    end

    critical Panel replacement
        Panel->>View: Construct candidate
        App->>View: build_from_store(context)
    option Build succeeds
        Panel->>View: Release replaced view
    option Build fails
        Panel->>View: close candidate
        Panel->>Panel: Restore original panel mapping
    end

    App->>View: close()
    View->>Store: Unsubscribe tier interests
    Panel->>Panel: Disconnect callbacks and destroy panel
